      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沙呀！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C995440FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等等啊，雷伊布！\n我才刚跟人家搭话。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B497B49554AFF0C96F74F0A5E03FF01000A6211624D521A8DDF4EBA5BB6642D8BDD300200100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "害你一头雾水了吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BB34F604E00593496FE6C344E865427FF1F00100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的雷伊布性格太过急躁。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211768496F74F0A5E036027683C592A8FC760258E81300200100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "刚刚它也是感受到了对战的氛围，\n于是就那么跑去对战场……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "521A521A5B834E5F662F611F53D752304E865BF9621876846C1B56F4FF0C000A4E8E662F5C3190A34E488DD153BB5BF96218573A2026202600100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以拜托你了！\n请跟我打宝可梦对战吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我会在对战场等你的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE562DC62584F604E86FF01000A8BF78DDF621162535B9D53EF68A65BF962185427300200100001BE00000A62114F1A57285BF96218573A7B494F607684300200100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你会和我们对战的吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604F1A548C62114EEC5BF9621876845427FF1F00100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沙呀！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C995440FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喂！\n人家还没回答我呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5582FF01000A4EBA5BB68FD86CA156DE7B5462115462300200100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真不愧是超Z队的人！\n实力毋庸置疑啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F4E0D6127662F8D85005A961F76844EBAFF01000A5B9E529B6BCB5EB87F6E7591554A300200100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的雷伊布它们性格很急躁，\n所以速度很快吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211768496F74F0A5E035B834EEC6027683C5F8860258E81FF0C000A62404EE5901F5EA65F885FEB5427FF0100100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有些宝可梦的性格\n是会提升速度的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094E9B5B9D53EF68A676846027683C000A662F4F1A63D05347901F5EA67684300200100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "急躁当然会，\n此外还有胆小、爽朗和天真也会。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60258E815F5371364F1AFF0C000A6B6459168FD8670980C65C0F3001723D6717548C5929771F4E5F4F1A300200100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且速度越快，\n出招所需的时间也会越短。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E14901F5EA68D8A5FEBFF0C000A51FA62DB62409700768465F695F44E5F4F1A8D8A77ED300200100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过无论再快，\n要出同一个招式还是需要3秒。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC765E08BBA518D5FEBFF0C000A898151FA540C4E004E2A62DB5F0F8FD8662F97008981003379D2300200100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "其他还有……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51764ED68FD867092026202600100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沙呀！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C995440FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你倒是等一下我，\n别自己跑去宝可梦中心啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605012662F7B494E004E0B6211FF0C000A522B81EA5DF18DD153BB5B9D53EF68A64E2D5FC3554AFF0100100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就是这样啦。\n拜拜＆谢谢！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C31662F8FD9683755663002000A62DC62DCFF068C228C22FF0100100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
